enter played in Detroit's Opening Night matchup against the Rangers, but wasn't able to suit up against Winnipeg on Sunday. He's coming off a sophomore slump offensively, where he posted nine goals and 19 points across 81 regular-season games in 2025-26. However, Kasper does a lot of work without the puck for the Red Wings, who will hope to have him back on the earlier side of his week-to-week timeline for return. In his absence, Nate Danielson will likely be a regular contributor up the center of the ice.","player":8483464.0,"return":"2026-10-20","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"DET"},{"date":"2026-10-16","name":"Cam York","note":"day-to-day","player":8481546.0,"return":"2026-10-17","src":"ESPN","status":"Day-To-Day","team":"PHI"},{"date":"2026-10-14","name":"Rasmus Ristolainen","note":"Ristolainen has been sidelined since early October due to his upper-body injury. He'll be sidelined for a sixth consecutive game Thursday but seems to be closer to day-to-day at this point despite remaining on injured reserve. The Flyers will return home for Saturday's game against the Senators, but it's not yet clear whether Ristolainen will get the green light to suit up in that matchup.","player":8477499.0,"return":"2026-10-17","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"PHI"},{"date":"2026-10-11","name":"Travis Konecny","note":"Konecny sat out Saturday's 5-1 loss to Boston and will miss additional time after moving to the IR list. It's unclear when he will be ready to return to the lineup, but he won't be an option for at least the next three games, starting with Sunday's matchup against Carolina.","player":8478439.0,"return":"2026-10-17","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"PHI"},{"date":"2026-10-10","name":"Nikita Grebenkin","note":"Grebenkin's upper-body injury has been revealed to be an issue with his back, which he has successfully had repaired. The 23-year-old winger is expected to miss the majority of the 2026-27 campaign, but his current timeline for return, barring any setbacks, projects him back sometime after the All-Star break in mid-February. When he does return, Grebenkin will look to build off a positive rookie campaign, where he compiled four goals, 14 points, 32 shots on net, 86 hits and 17 blocked shots across 55 regular-season outings in 2025-26.","player":8483733.0,"return":"2027-02-13","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"PHI"},{"date":"2026-10-06","name":"Mason Appleton","note":"Undisclosed: The Detroit Red Wings placed F Mason Appleton on injured reserve on Tuesday (Oct. 6).","player":8478891.0,"return":null,"src":"HR","status":"Out","team":"DET"},{"date":"2026-10-06","name":"J.T. Compher","note":"Undisclosed: Compher did not play in Tuesday's (Oct 13) game versus the Devils.","player":8477456.0,"return":null,"src":"HR","status":"Out","team":"DET"},{"date":"2026-10-03","name":"Marco Kasper","note":"Upper Body: The Detroit Red Wings placed F Marco Kasper on injured reserve and has been given a week-to-week timetable for return.","player":8483464.0,"return":null,"src":"HR","status":"Out","team":"DET"},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"Nikita Grebenkin","note":"Upper-body: The Philadelphia Flyers placed F Nikita Grebenkin on injured reserve and is expected to miss at least four months.","player":8483733.0,"return":null,"src":"HR","status":"Out","team":"PHI"},{"date":"2026-10-10","name":"Travis Konecny","note":"Lower Body: The Philadelphia Flyers placed F Travis Konecny on injured reserve.","player":8478439.0,"return":null,"src":"HR","status":"Out","team":"PHI"},{"date":"2026-10-03","name":"Rasmus Ristolainen","note":"Upper-body: The Philadelphia Flyers said that Ristolainen won't travel with the team ahead of Thursday's (Oct. 15) game against the Red Wings but is closing in on a return, per Charlie O'Connor of PHLY Sports.","player":8477499.0,"return":null,"src":"HR","status":"Out","team":"PHI"},{"date":"2026-10-10","name":"Cam York","note":"Upper Body: York is OUT for Thursday's (Oct